---
import SubpageLayout from '../../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import contactData from '../../../data/contact.json';
---

<SubpageLayout title="Kain kõme" description="Contact the Republic of Nauru guide team — questions, feedback and practical travel help." sectionEmoji="✉️" sectionLabel="Kain kõme" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true} locale="na">
  <p><strong>Kain kõme</strong> is the fastest way to reach us if you have a question about the website, a correction to share, or a practical issue you could not solve on the pages above.</p>

  <h2>Contact information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>{contactData.address}</strong></li>
    <li><strong>{contactData.phone}</strong></li>
    <li><strong>{contactData.email}</strong></li>
    <li><strong>{contactData.hours}</strong></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="info-box">
    <h4>{contactData.emergency}</h4>
    <p>For police, fire or medical emergencies while in Nauru, dial the appropriate emergency number above. For non-urgent medical matters, contact Nauru General Hospital on +674 557 3150.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Send us a message</h2>
  <p>Use the form below to send us a message. Fields marked with * are required.</p>

  <form class="contact-form" action="#" method="post">
    <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name / Inam" required />
    <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email / Imel" required />
    <input type="text" placeholder="Subject / Tema" />
    <textarea placeholder="Your Message / Mesedj" required></textarea>
    <button type="button" class="submit-btn">Send Message →</button>
  </form>

  <h2>Visiting in person?</h2>
  <p>The Government Information Office is located in the Government Complex in Yaren District. Walk-in visitors are welcome during business hours (Monday–Friday, 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM Nauru Time UTC+12). It is still best to call ahead if you need a specific department.</p>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .contact-form input,
  .contact-form textarea {
    border: 2px solid #1a1a2e;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color .25s;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .contact-form input:focus,
  .contact-form textarea:focus {
    border-color: #FFC72C;
  }
  .contact-form textarea {
    min-height: 120px;
    resize: vertical;
  }
  .submit-btn {
    background: #002B7F;
    color: #FFC72C;
    border: none;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer;
    clip-path: polygon(8px 0%,100% 0%,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0% 100%);
    transition: all .25s;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .submit-btn:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
</style>
